edby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T02:20:07-07:00","id":1445451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raziel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1369651-should-kuei-jin-be-in-v5?p=1445449#post1445449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> yeah, speaking of the Faces Of The Gods. I made the dharma followers in the Philippines usually get into conflicts with kithain/hsien since they fight for worshippers, Wan Kuei and their fairy rivals refer to them as the pekeng diwata (false fairy in Filipino)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nice.<br /> <br /> Have you had a look at Dion Fernandez's take on the Pinoy WoD over on Storytellers Vault? Some excellent work there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T04:51:34-07:00","id":1445460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1369651-should-kuei-jin-be-in-v5?p=1445451#post1445451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Nice.<br /> <br /> Have you had a look at Dion Fernandez's take on the Pinoy WoD over on Storytellers Vault? Some excellent work there.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> yeah, wish he could do changeling, mage, and werewolf as well since I take inspiration from his works and even the Ghost Family books when I run games in my country or some parts in Asia. I made the Bone Gnawers be responsible for the stories of the weredog variant of Aswangs and there is a Reality Zone in Siquijor where members of a craft of witches called the Mangkukulam live.<br /> <br /> currently, running one myself set in a province in the Visayas region.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25313-raziel","name":"Raziel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T05:09:14-07:00","id":1445463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raziel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1369651-should-kuei-jin-be-in-v5?p=1445460#post1445460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> yeah, wish he could do changeling, mage, and werewolf as well since I take inspiration from his works and even the Ghost Family books when I run games in my country or some parts in Asia. I made the Bone Gnawers be responsible for the stories of the weredog variant of Aswangs and there is a Reality Zone in Siquijor where members of a craft of witches called the Mangkukulam live.<br /> <br /> currently, running one myself set in a province in the Visayas region.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Nice. I played a Mangkukulam Orphan in a short lived Mage game a while ago.<br /> <br /> Most of my SE Asian material is based in Indo and Island Malaysia plus my Australian and Melanesian campaign notes.<br /> <br /> I'd like to hear more about your Visayas region chronicle. <br /> <br /> I've gotten a lot of use out of The Aswang Project when I've touched on the Phillipines in my chronicles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T05:53:23-07:00","id":1445467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1369651-should-kuei-jin-be-in-v5?p=1445347#post1445347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The big irony is that its not remotely pro-Christian as the setting basis is God is evil. That's like saying Shin Megami Tensei is pro-Christian.<br /> <br /> However, the objection seems not to be that God is Good or God is Evil, it is that God is real.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yup, 'God' as the Werewolf Totem 'The Patriarch' is fine, that is a belief based Umbrood of some kind, God as Yhwh, even a weird, gnostic-ish version, is not fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T06:00:33-07:00","id":1445469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1369651-should-kuei-jin-be-in-v5?p=1445467#post1445467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yup, 'God' as the Werewolf Totem 'The Patriarch' is fine, that is a belief based Umbrood of some kind, God as Yhwh, even a weird, gnostic-ish version, is not fine.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the Patriarch is one of the worst ideas in the entirety of the setting and one of the few times the game has just actively pissed me off. Because it's not even good satire. Its just hate speech.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-eb